open Matrix

namespace AutoQMem.Lindblad.Supplement

open AutoQMem.Lindblad

/-- **Theorem 4 (Floquet autonomous quantum memory from SPCAs).** Drechsler, Oreg, Aharonov,
*Autonomous Quantum Memories from Classical Stochastic Processes*, arXiv:2610.05589 (PDF of
2026-11-03), Theorem 4, p. 31 (PDF 33); proof §7, pp. 50–61 (PDF 52–63), App. D–E.

Let `C_X, C_Z` be a pair of CSS-compatible classical codes with bounded-degree interaction graphs and
linear size `L`. Fix a designated logical qubit and readout decoders, with logical-error indicators
`b_X, b_Z`. Suppose that, for each sector `σ`, the component code `C_σ` admits an `R_σ`-local SPCA
`Ψ_σ` with update rule `a^{(σ)}`, where `R_σ` is independent of `L`, and that there is `p_c > 0`,
independent of `L`, such that for every `p < p_c`, `Ψ_σ` at fault rate `p`, started at `0`,
`q_σ(m, L)`-remembers `b_σ` through round `m`. Then there exist a threshold `η_c > 0`, independent of
`L`, and a geometrically local periodic Lindbladian `L_PCA(t)` with period `Δ` independent of `L`,
acting on the code qubits together with local classical registers, such that under local Pauli noise
of rate `η < η_c` on the code qubits and the registers, the encoded system evolving under `L_PCA(t)`
is a quantum `q(m, L)`-memory at cycle boundaries through cycle `m`, with
`q(m, L) = q_X(m, L) + q_Z(m, L)`. `L_PCA(t)` is translationally invariant whenever the code pair and
both SPCAs are.

**Formalization Note.**
* The family is indexed by `L : ℕ`: codes `C L` on `n' L + 1` qubits, logical qubits, decoders,
  rules `a^{(σ,L)}`. "Bounded degree" is a uniform bound `D` on the degrees of the interaction
  graphs of `C_X^L` and `C_Z^L`; `R_X, R_Z, p_c` do not depend on `L`; `q_σ : ℕ → ℕ → ℝ` is
  `(m, L) ↦ q_σ(m, L)`. The memory hypothesis is assumed for every fault rate `0 ≤ p < p_c`, every
  `L` and every `m` (Definition 2.40, every run on every probability space).
* `L_PCA = L_c + L^aug_noise` (eq. (195)). The witness is the correction part `L_c^L`: a
  register-extended syndrome-based Lindbladian (Definition 7.1, which Claim 7.8 proves of the
  construction) on the data and a register set with at most `K` registers per site ("local
  classical registers"), `R`-local (Definition 2.23, registers counted at their site), periodic with
  period `Δ`, and equivariant under every symmetry of the code pair and both rules (translation
  invariance). `η_c, Δ, R, K` are chosen before `L`; `L_c^L` before the noise and `m`.
* Noise: every rate family with `0 ≤ γ_{P,i}(t), γ^reg_{P,j}(t) ≤ η` (eq. (194)), measurable in `t`
  (Remark 2.26). `W` is the propagator of `L_c^L + L^ext_noise` (eq. (40), Reading R1); the data
  channel at the cycle boundary `rΔ` is `ρ ↦ Tr_reg W(rΔ)(ρ ⊗ |0⟩⟨0|_reg)` (Corollary 7.3), and the
  memory bound is required for every `r ≤ m`. -/
theorem theorem_4 (n' mX mZ : ℕ → ℕ) (C : ∀ L, CSSCode (n' L + 1) (mX L) (mZ L))
    (Q : ∀ L, LogicalQubit (C L)) (DX : ∀ L, Decoder (C L).HX) (DZ : ∀ L, Decoder (C L).HZ)
    (D : ℕ) (hdegX : ∀ L, DegreeLE (checkGraph (C L).HX) D)
    (hdegZ : ∀ L, DegreeLE (checkGraph (C L).HZ) D)
    (RX RZ : ℕ) (aX : ∀ L, (Fin (mX L) → ZMod 2) → (Fin (n' L + 1) → ZMod 2))
    (aZ : ∀ L, (Fin (mZ L) → ZMod 2) → (Fin (n' L + 1) → ZMod 2))
    (haX : ∀ L, IsLocalRule (C L).HX RX (aX L)) (haZ : ∀ L, IsLocalRule (C L).HZ RZ (aZ L))
    (pc : ℝ) (hpc : 0 < pc) (qX qZ : ℕ → ℕ → ℝ)
    (hmemX : ∀ p : ℝ, 0 ≤ p → p < pc → ∀ L m,
      SPCARemembers (C L).HX (aX L) p 0 (decodedValue (C L).HX (Q L).lX (DX L)) m (qX m L))
    (hmemZ : ∀ p : ℝ, 0 ≤ p → p < pc → ∀ L m,
      SPCARemembers (C L).HZ (aZ L) p 0 (decodedValue (C L).HZ (Q L).lZ (DZ L)) m (qZ m L)) :
    ∃ ηc Δ : ℝ, 0 < ηc ∧ 0 < Δ ∧ ∃ R K : ℕ,
    ∃ (Rg : ∀ L, Registers (n' L + 1)) (Lc : ∀ L, RegSyndromeLindbladian (C L) (Rg L)),
      (∀ L, (∀ i, (regsAt (Rg L) {i}).card ≤ K) ∧ (Lc L).IsPeriodic Δ ∧
        IsRLocalExt (Lc L) R ∧ IsEquivariant (Lc L) (aX L) (aZ L)) ∧
      ∀ (L : ℕ) (η : ℝ), η < ηc →
        ∀ (γ : ℝ → Pauli1 → Fin (n' L + 1) → ℝ) (γreg : ℝ → Pauli1 → (Rg L).Reg → ℝ),
          IsNoiseOfRate (Rg L) η γ γreg →
          ∀ W : ℝ → (Rg L).Op → (Rg L).Op,
            IsPropagatorOf (fun t ρ => (Lc L).gen t ρ + extNoiseGen (Rg L) γ γreg t ρ) W →
            ∀ m : ℕ, IsQuantumMemoryThrough (Q L) (DX L) (DZ L)
              (fun r => reducedMap (Rg L) (W (r * Δ))) m (qX m L + qZ m L) := by sorry

end AutoQMem.Lindblad.Supplement
